    "media:imagetext": "CLE\nCertificate for less\nthan 100 Shares\nCertificate for less\nthan 100 Shares\nNo. O\nSHARES OF THE CAPITAL STOCK WITHOUT PAR VALUE OF\nTHE\n3746\nCORPORATION CHANGED TO SHARES OF CAPITAL STOCK OF THE\nPAR VALUE OF $10. EACH BY AMENDMENT TO THE CERTIFICATE OF ..\nINCORPORATION OF THE CORPORATION, EFFECTIVE JULY 8, 1932\n-72- Shares\nPan American Airways Corporation\nIncorporated under the Laws of the State of Delaware\nTHIS IS TO CERTIFY that. - WILLIAM S. PALEY-\nis the owner of\n-SEVENTY THREE-\nfull paid and\n2c7-assessable shares, without nominal or par value, of the capital stock of\nPAN AMERICAN AIRWAYS CORPORATION\ntransferable in person or by duly authorized attorney upon surrender of this Certificate, properly endorsed.\nthis Certificate is issued subject to all the terms of the Corporation's Certificate of Incorporation as\nanuelded and By-Laws as amended (copies of which are on file at the office of the Transfer Agent,\n*o which reference is hereby made with the same effect as if they were herein set forth in full and to all\nthe provisions of which the holder hereof by acceptance of this Certificate assents. This Certificate is\nnoC valid until countersigned by the Transfer Agent and registered by the Registrar.\nARMANS\nWITNESS the seal of the Corporation and the signatures of its duly\nauthorized officers.\nORPOR\nSEAL\n192\n8\nCORPO\nDated:.\nPAN AMER CAN AIR NAYS CORPORATION,\nLAWAR\nAssistant Cashier.\nAgent,\nCOUNTERSIGNED:\nTHE CHASE NATIONAL BANK OF THE CITY OF NEW WORK,\nFuton Manne\nSNETS\n2\n8\nSTINN",
